## Interface: 16001
## Title: Classic UI Restoration
## Notes: Restores the classic (pre-Dragonflight) look of portraits, cast bars, breath/fatigue bars, health bars, power bars, unit frames, nameplates, the minimap, the loot window, the trainer window, the auction house, the vendor window's icons, the action bar gryphons and the action bar art. Every element can be switched back to the modern look individually.
